 minimalist user interface collectively offer a lifelike portrayal of the horrors AJ is enduring.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game includes a variety of items that could assist AJ in his escape, all of which can be stored in an inventory system. Throughout the game, numerous interactable objects enhance the overall dynamism of the experience. Proximity voice chat also plays a significant role in the experience. AJ can communicate with his friend, but caution is necessary\u2014 the entities can hear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2493670/extras/items_gif.gif?t=1739827717\" /></p>","developers":["Mihnea Simionescu"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2493670/header.jpg?t=1739827717","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Copyright \u00a9 2024 Mihnea Simionescu. All rights reserved.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257054545,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257054545/movie480.mp4?t=1727619012","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257054545/movie_max.mp4?t=1727619012"},"name":"Early Access Trailer 1","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257054545/04e9a6cc26ac14d616133a8beaf635e31a1da48b/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1727619012","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257054545/movie480_